# skills: Jian's Stone Throw (level 4, 3 MP, one enemy, his ordinary physical hit at range). Jian alone at
# level 4 (level index 3 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle (five enemies). Special lists
# Stone Throw alone (st_list: "Stone Throw", 3, "Throw a stone at one monster"); A opens the enemy grid,
# Right moves to the second back-row enemy (battler 5), A throws. Expect: Jian stays where he stands (no
# run-in, no leap), tosses the stone and swings, and the stone flies to battler 5 along the path of Flora's
# arrows; MP 50 -> 47 (st_00 to st_59). Seen: all of that, and the stone MISSes there (an ordinary
# hit roll, his DEX against its AGI; the hit is test_skill_stone_throw_hit).
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: HP +0x14, MP +0x18). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 3
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
peek u32 0x020B8640 battlers_base
watch u32 0x0228E878 jian_mp
watch u32 0x0228EAB0 hp5
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
shot st_list
press A 8
wait 70
shot st_grid
